window.products.push({"id":849189,"name":"KitchenCraft Colourworks Silicone Slotted Spoon, 27 cm - Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41tfcY6FTML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With the Kitchen Craft Colourworks Red Silicone Slotted Spoon there’s no need to worry about plates or bowls getting soggy when you serve foods. It features a rigid nylon core, which is coated with a layer of flexible silicone. Heat resistant to temperatures as high as 260 degrees Celsius / 500 degrees Fahrenheit, you can easily lift cooked fruits, vegetables and dumplings straight from the saucepan for serving. The spoon features three straining slots, which enable water to drain away quickly while preventing food from slipping through. Its silicone coating is also easy scrape and anti-scratch. So, there’s no need to worry about the Colourworks Red Silicone Slotted Spoon damaging your non-stick or ceramic coated cookware. Sturdy to provide a more comfortable grip, its handle is also anti-slip and heat resistant. Cleaning it up afterwards is a doddle. Silicone is stain and odour resistant. So, it doesn’t matter how strong the foods you use it with are, it won’t absorb any colours, flavours or odours. Leaving you with the simple task or rinsing it down with warm water or popping it in your dishwasher. You can also hang it up on your utensils rack – thanks to its integrated hanging loop. And what’s more, it also comes with a five year guarantee! Mix and match. Combine and contrast. The Colourworks range from Kitchen Craft features hundreds of clever kitchen tools and accessories in 10 more amazing colours. So, why not liven up your kitchen kit today! About Colourworks The perfect blend of vibrancy and practicality, the Colourworks range by Kitchen Craft features more than 400 essential kitchen tools, gadgets, knives and accessories in 11 vibrant colours. Don't let the fun colours fool you, this is seriously high performance kitchen kit, designed to deliver incredible reliability on a daily basis. Using a variety of materials across the whole collection, including flexible LFGB grade, food-safe silicone, strong stainless steel, virtually unbreakable melamine and durable nylon, each product in our range provides fantastic performance whatever the cooking task.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41tfcY6FTML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KitchenCraft","source_asin":"B004UBK9QU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-849189","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004UBK9QU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004UBK9QU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
