window.products.push({"id":849210,"name":"roro Rustic Country Wooden Wall Art Made from Circular Roots, 16\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711bUnO6FBL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Purely artisinal... K. Weera is an artist who began humbly by making the plaques that other, established artists would purchase in order to mount their items. He had a knack for turning aging and discarded wood and perfecting their already distressed look, which other artists prized. Within the past couple years, he has mastered this distressed form (from treating the wood to hand-crafting it), and started his own business. He is able to turn discarded wood items or scrap wood and with care and attention, cultivate them into magnificent works of art. Recently his works have started appearing in hotels and resorts throughout Thailand, and more recently, in boutique hotels in the US. We worked extensively with K. Weera to create a piece that was both beautiful and natural. This particular piece has several roots cleverly twisted together to create a stunning visual that will look charming on your wall. This is a definite conversation piece and is a suitable office, dining room, hotel room, or den piece. Enjoy! Item comes individual boxed and ready to mount. Please clean with a feather duster. Also please note that no two pieces will be alike - and there will be minor variations in the style, slight diameter differences and possibly thickness","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711bUnO6FBL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"roro","source_asin":"B01M7QDE2R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-849210","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M7QDE2R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M7QDE2R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
