window.products.push({"id":849465,"name":"Modern Artisans Our Lady of Guadalupe Handmade Patron Saint Retablo Plaque, 3.5 x 7.25 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jB0n8REpL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Long a popular folk art form in colonial Spanish and Mexican culture, retablos are devotional images depicting divine icons and patron saints Displayed in homes to honor the saint or given as gifts of fortune and inspiration, retablos reflect a beloved historical tradition and cultural artistry An original design by the artist, the art print is decoupaged upon handcarved pine wood in traditional form Reverse includes a hole for hanging and a story of the St Mary the Blessed Virgin / Our Lady of Guadalupe Made by hand in the USA ; Measures 3.5W x 7.25H","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jB0n8REpL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Modern Artisans","source_asin":"B01C980IUC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-849465","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01C980IUC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01C980IUC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":849466,"name":"Thermique Freestanding Heated Glass Towel Warmer - Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31GXqTon6pL._AC_.jpg","description":"Start each day with a moment of simple joy by wrapping yourself in a warm towel! The Thermique heated glass towel warmer provides you with a five-star spa experience at home every day, while enhancing your bathroom with its elegant yet powerful design.   No other towel warmer is as beautiful as a Thermique heated glass towel warmer. For the first time, you can have a towel warmer that matches your décor and not just your fixtures!   Thermique Towel Warmers are available in three designer colors black, white, or cream and require no wall space or professional installation. Drape cloth items directly over the glass panel for even and efficient heating. It's also perfect for drying towels and delicates, warming blankets, and more!   UL Approved. Free Shipping inside the Continental US!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31GXqTon6pL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Thermique","source_asin":"B001BZGXH2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-849466","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001BZGXH2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001BZGXH2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":849467,"name":"Lush Decor Washable and Durable, 72\" x 72\" Bathroom Shower Curtain with Bold Trellis Print on Soft Fabric, Light Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KNBUTJuPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Giving your bathroom a refresh instantly makes you feel better about your home. You start every day getting ready in your bathroom, and you deserve to feel good about that space. One of the quickest redo tricks is to swap out an old shower curtain with a brand new one. Suddenly, your space feels vibrant and alive again. Adding a shower curtain that’s made of fabric rather than plastic or vinyl creates a sense of elevation and elegance that is sure to put a smile on your face.One of today’s hottest trends is bold, geometric prints that add drama and excitement without being too fussy. Not only are traditional prints getting some attention, returning to classic colors is also a must. Gray is the color of the year, and it’s one of the things that makes this Lush Decor Shower Curtain so wonderful. It’s all the inspiration you need to give your space a makeover that’s going to make you want to spend more time in your master bathroom.While luxury is the name of the game, this Lush Decor Shower Curtain hasn’t forgotten about convenience. Durable polyester construction has a resilient nature that always looks great, but when it’s time to clean, you’ll appreciate that it’s machine washable. Make sure to tuck your shower curtain into a mesh laundry bag, wash on a cold, gentle cycle, and only use non-chlorine bleach if necessary. Tumble dry on low and use a cool iron, if needed.At Lush Decor, we offer a range of home products that are luxurious yet affordable. All of our products are made by a team of in-house designers who aim to create items that are functional, fashionable, and unique. Shop our line of home accessories, ranging from curtains to bedding.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KNBUTJuPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lush Decor","source_asin":"B08163YT6C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-849467","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08163YT6C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08163YT6C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
