window.products.push({"id":849579,"name":"18 Inches Handmade Christmas Gnome Decoration Swedish Figurines (Khaki)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aizzjN1HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★100% HANDMADE – Each gnome is individually handmade with lots of love! They are original designed by Swedish artist and handmade unique one by one. ★GNOME STORY – The Gnome also known as Tomte or Nisse. A Gnome is a mythological creature from Scandinavian folklore today typically associated with the winter solstice and the Christmas season. ★ABOUT SIZE – The total length of these gnomes are 16-19 inch tall from bottom to top including length of hat. 3.5 inch wide. ★TOP QUANTITY – Each gnome are handmade of top & safe materials. These gnomes come with a perfect gift box. ★HOLIDAY GIFTS – These gnomes doll are an adorable tradition perfect for spreading the holiday spirit. They are perfect gift for Thanksgiving and Christmas holiday decoration.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aizzjN1HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LARLIFE","source_asin":"B07Y8QZX65","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-849579","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y8QZX65","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y8QZX65","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
