window.products.push({"id":849726,"name":"U-Taste 18/8 Stainless Steel Cooling Rack 12.2 x 8.4 inches, Baking Cooking Roasting Grilling Rack with Welding Enhancement, 4 Legs, 2 Cross Bars for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716TZF5lGEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"-Not just make it, we upgrade it- We are a professional kitchenware producer who have been focus on customer experience. In order to offer better and eco-friendly kitchenware, U-Taste collects customer reviews of all similar products on Amazon. And then upgrade the products based on the data of the bad evaluation with the aim to provide customers with more perfect kitchenware products. -Anti-rust 18/8 Stainless Steel- Because of the 18/8 stainless steel, it doesn't rust or corrode like the chrome plated kind and cheap stainless steel kind, meeting 16.77% picky buyers' need. You can put it in dishwasher for easy cleanup and no rust spots show up. Also no flake, no coating and no plating. It helps food cool more quickly. Measure your pan before purchasing. S: 12.2 x 8.4 inches; M: 14.3 x 9.8 inches; L: 16.3 x 11.3 inches. -No weld issues and no rough edges- With upgraded argon-arc welding, the steel-wire end-points are strongly welded, and are then machined down with high-precision making them very smooth to the touch. No burrs at the welds and no sharp edges to cut you or snag dish towels or scrubbers while handling this rack, dispelling 7.27% buyers' worries. The construction is \"beefy\" and it won't come apart easily. -Dense wires keep food from falling through- The spacing between the wires is sufficiently small to support smaller items, while still being easy to clean. Nothing is going to fall through. The diameter of the inner wires is 1.5mm while the outer one is 4mm, along with 3 strong supporting bars on the bottom side, strong enough to support your food and do not bend easily, banishing 17.57% buyers' worries. -Versatile features- You can using it for cooling, baking, roasting, cooking and grilling. With 6 raised feet (2.5mm thick), you can place cookies hot from the oven onto the rack - the height allows air to circulate beneath to give each cookie the perfect crisp. The height also allows grease to drip from meats. It is also sturdy enough to support heavier weights. 7.48% buyers enjoy the convenience of this feature.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716TZF5lGEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"U-Taste","source_asin":"B092337D8S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-849726","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092337D8S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092337D8S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
