window.products.push({"id":849737,"name":"4 x 4 Square Format Photo Albums for Social Media Pack of 3, Each Mini Album Holds Up to 48 4x4 Photos. Flexible, Removable Covers Come in Random, Ass","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Hzg2-6j4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SQUARE SOCIAL MEDIA SIZE IN HARD-TO-FIND LIGHTWEIGHT, SOFT PHOTO ALBUMS with a variety of random, assorted cover colors and patterns. Show off your selfies, memes, foodie photos, style snaps, and insta pics. Make a quotivational photo book. Collect your adventures. Put together a gallery of your filtered snaps. Create a salesbook. Showcase fitness, gadget, fashion, pet, friend, travel, motivational, quote and review posts. STURDY YET STILL FLEXIBLE BRAG BOOKS feature a heavier 0.2mm cover and unique prints you won’t find in stores. Each photo album in this pack holds up to 48 photos (that’s a lot of pictures!). With the three photo albums in this bundle, you can store up to 144 square photos. THE DURABLE POCKETS keep photos or other memorabilia secure - opening is on interior edge towards the spine. Each page holds a single photo. Made of polypropylene, pockets are non-glare, acid-free, archival quality, with no ink lift-off. Use them to organize more than just your photos - ideal to easily flip through travel memories, busy books, flashcards, recipes, coupons, home improvement projects and anything else you need to easily sort and store in this adorably fat little format. THE FLEXIBLE COVER has a cardstock insert that can be easily swapped out. Keep the beautiful covers that come with the albums, or remove them to insert your own photo or artwork for a custom, personalized album. Preserve your photos and projects. PERFECT GIFT FOR social media darlings, photographers, travelers, new parents, grandparents, pet owners, graduates, newlyweds, teachers, students, homeschoolers, kids, couponers, in-home party consultants and more. Store, display and showcase your 4x4 photographs, school and homeschool projects, graphic design, presentations, art, autographed photos, modeling portfolios, watercolors, sketches, drawings and paintings.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Hzg2-6j4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CocoPolka","source_asin":"B07DX9DRPT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-849737","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DX9DRPT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DX9DRPT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
