window.products.push({"id":849852,"name":"MIRA 15 oz Kids Stainless Steel Water Bottle - Thermos Insulated Flask Keeps Cold - One Touch Straw Lid Cap, Blue - Planets","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pVR8rW11L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Innovative Vacuum Insulation: Our highly rated insulated water bottle keeps drinks ice cold for 24 hours or piping hot for 12 hours. Using our MiraGuard Technology, your thermos water bottle maintains inside temperatures for hours and prevents condensation from forming on the bottle’s exterior. Functional Style: Use this compact flask for storing cold water, juices, or warm milk. Pack this leak proof, spill proof, slim water bottle in lunch boxes, backpacks or purses. Our water bottles come in many fun colors for boys and girls. The sleek and modern design of the travel water bottle makes it great for adults as well. Straw Lid: Open your insulated bottle with the simple push of a button. The bottle has a protective lid that keeps the drinking straw spout clean. Pack your spill proof and sweat proof hydro canteen in your bag or backpack without worrying about spills. The wide mouth opening fits ice cubes and makes cleaning your stainless steel water bottle a breeze! Built to Last: This kids water bottle is durable enough for any adventure! Made from 18/8 food-grade stainless steel, our metal water bottle always provides a pure, clean taste that won’t retain or transfer flavors. Whether it’s time to play soccer or catch some swell waves, this sports water bottle will always be there to provide maximum hydration. Health in Mind: Staying healthy just got simple with our BPA free water bottle that's made from safe, non-toxic materials. With our reusable water bottle, you can feel hydrated all day long. For the coldest beverage, add ice cubes to your hydro canteen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pVR8rW11L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MIRA Brands","source_asin":"B09PYGG3W7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-849852","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PYGG3W7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PYGG3W7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":849853,"name":"LEVOIT Air Purifier LV-PUR131 Replacement True HEPA & Activated Carbon Filters Set (2 Pack) & LV-H132 Air Purifier Replacement Filter, 3-in-1 Nylon, T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":118.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515XZenxbGL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"LEVOIT Air Purifier LV-PUR131 Replacement Filter True HEPA & Activated Carbon Filters Set, LV-PUR131-RF , (2 Pack)Genuine Levoit Replacement Filter Designed specifically for the Levoit LV-PUR131 & LV-PUR131S, these certified Levoit brand replacement air filters allow you to keep producing fresh air for your home. Replacing the Air Filters To replace your the    air filters in your LV-PUR131 or LV-PUR131S air purifier follow the steps below:  1) With the air purifier off, unplug the air purifier and remove the back cover  2) Remove the old air filters and properly dispose of them  3) Unwrap the new air filters. Place the Activated Carbon filter inside the housing first, making sure the pull tabs are facing the opening  4) Install the True HEPA filter into the housing; make sure the pull tabs are facing the opening.   5) Replace the back cover onto the housing  6) Plug in and turn on the air purifier. Use a pen or a pencil to press the black reset button inside the vent on the side of the air purifier. The \"Change Filter\" symbol should now be off. Be sure to also clean the dust sensor on the side of the air purifier using a clean cotton swab.When Should I Replace My Filters? The air filters can be used for up to 6 months, depending on how often your air purifier is used. If you need additional help, feel free to reach out to our helpful Levoit support.Package Contents2 x Fine Preliminary w/ True HEPA Filters2 x Activated Carbon FiltersLEVOIT LV-H132 Air Purifier Replacement Filter, 3-in-1 Nylon Pre-Filter, True HEPA Filter, High-Efficiency Activated Carbon Filter, LV-H132-RF, 2 Pack,BlackLevoit LV-H 132 Air Purifier Replacement Filter, LV-H132-RF, 2pack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515XZenxbGL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LEVOIT","source_asin":"B08CWBWJ5T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-849853","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CWBWJ5T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CWBWJ5T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
