window.products.push({"id":849859,"name":"NTETSN African Woman Shower Curtain, Afro Traditional Women Washable Upgrade Polyester Fabric Bath Curtain with 12 Hooks, 72 x 72 Inches, DSNT741-72","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+uFcoE1YL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Designer Say: NTETSN shower curtain is a fantastic way to bring life, color and fun to any bathroom of your home. It is a truly wonderful feeling when you are surround yourself with positive happy colors. Material: Upgrade Polyester Size: 72W x 72L inches Included: 1 x Shower Curtain ,12 x Free white “C” type plastic hooks. Sizes Available: 48W x 72L,60W x 72L,72W x 72L and Custom size. Why choose NTETSN shower curtain? ☆HD digital printing-Clear: Adopting HD print and featuring vivid colors, crisp lines, clearly and not fade, enough to light your bathroom. ☆High quality-Environment-Friendly: All products are durable no irritating odor, no fading, PVC free, better protection for your family and your health. ☆Easy use & care: 100% polyester, light weight, easy hanging and storage. Rust-resistant metal grommets along reinforced top header. The rust-resistant metal grommets inner diameter 0.4 inch, the hook can easily pass through the stainless steel hole. Weighted hem helps keep it in place.use it for the bottom of a shower curtain, it makes them hang down evenly. Hand wash or machine gently wash in the cold water. Hang dry only. Please iron it at a lower temperature. Note: ❶ Do not bleach. ❷ Since all product folds are sent to you in small package sizes, the product may wrinkle, which is normal. When you hang it in the bathroom, the damp water vapor will quickly smooth the fabric. Does not affect the beauty and use of the shower curtain. Do not iron at high temperatures. You do not iron it after washing, just remove from dryer early, and hang - no wrinkles. ❸ Color difference allowed for light and screen effects. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us and we will reply to you as soon as possible. Thank you and Best wishes! Sincerely, NTETSN","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+uFcoE1YL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NTETSN","source_asin":"B083Q35RR8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-849859","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083Q35RR8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083Q35RR8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
