window.products.push({"id":849897,"name":"ORIENTAL FURNITURE 3 ft. Short Diamond Weave Fiber Room Divider - Dark Mocha - 4 Panel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91M8-MUKIlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A lightweight but sturdy screen, each panel consists of plant fiber woven in a diamond pattern over durable, kiln-dried wooden frames. The three foot tall screen sports an open weave design, allowing some light and air to pass through. Use it as a decorative background or functional divider in your living room, study or place of business.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91M8-MUKIlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ORIENTAL Furniture","source_asin":"B0BH7CPMRD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-849897","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BH7CPMRD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BH7CPMRD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":849898,"name":"The Thames Near Windsor by Joseph Turner, 35x47-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FUqMB+JfL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery wrapped art piece features people a river. Joseph Turner was a British Romantic landscape painter, water-colourist, and printmaker. Turner was considered a controversial figure in his day, but is now regarded as the artist who elevated landscape painting to an eminence rivalling history painting. Although renowned for his oil paintings, Turner is also one of the greatest masters of British watercolour landscape painting. He is commonly known as \"the painter of light\" and his work is regarded as a Romantic preface to Impressionism.  Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FUqMB+JfL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00GSPKJNO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-849898","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GSPKJNO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GSPKJNO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
